RELAXED_BOX 71.7015502059251 71.7014185941052 71.7033746996921

# These formulas define the derivatives w.r.t. strain components
# Constants uses $, variables use v_
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-${pxx0})/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-8.16969264508069)/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-8.16969264508069)/(v_delta/v_len0)*0.0001
